WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.677
Page 3, AI Fun! Can AI be a leaf detective too? Let’s find out!

2
00:00:07.877 --> 00:00:11.545
With a grown-up, find one fallen leaf and the tree it came from.

3
00:00:11.865 --> 00:00:15.116
Remember: do not touch or taste unknown plants.

4
00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:18.917
Step 1: Take two photos.

5
00:00:19.237 --> 00:00:22.673
Photo A: one leaf, close and clear.

6
00:00:22.993 --> 00:00:25.965
Photo B: the whole tree, from a safe distance.

7
00:00:27.165 --> 00:00:30.509
Step 2: Send Photo A to AI.

8
00:00:30.829 --> 00:00:39.281
Your grown-up can use any AI app you already have, like ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude, or Copilot.

9
00:00:39.601 --> 00:00:40.809
Type or say:

10
00:00:41.129 --> 00:00:44.379
“What tree is this leaf from? Name two clues.”

11
00:00:44.699 --> 00:00:47.021
AI answers with a guess and two clues.

12
00:00:48.221 --> 00:00:51.472
Step 3: Send Photo B to AI.

13
00:00:51.792 --> 00:00:53.836
In the same chat, type or say:

14
00:00:54.156 --> 00:00:57.546
“Here is the whole tree. What is your best guess now?”

15
00:00:57.866 --> 00:01:00.420
Look! AI changed its guess.

16
00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:04.406
Step 4: Find the real answer.

17
00:01:04.726 --> 00:01:11.506
Ask your grown-up to check a trusted source: a tree sign or label, a plant guidebook, or a teacher or nature expert.

18
00:01:11.826 --> 00:01:12.987
Was AI right?

19
00:01:13.337 --> 00:01:17.981
Almost! AI knew it was a maple, but not which kind.

20
00:01:19.181 --> 00:01:24.150
AI matches photo patterns, like leaf shape and veins, to labels it learned.

21
00:01:24.470 --> 00:01:26.467
This is called image recognition.

22
00:01:27.667 --> 00:01:29.339
But AI can make mistakes.

23
00:01:29.659 --> 00:01:32.678
A blurry photo or a look-alike leaf can fool it.

24
00:01:32.998 --> 00:01:35.134
So always check with a trusted source.

25
00:01:36.334 --> 00:01:42.093
Just like a real detective: always check the clues! Pause and try it with your grown-up.
